OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: Outside In
OL,6,     FClive Myrie talks with people of
OL,7,     Fcolour about their lives as
OL,8,     Fclassical musicians.
OL,9,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,10,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,11,     Fof all styles as requested by you,
OL,12,     Fincluding cuts from Duke
OL,13,     FEllington, The Vampires, Madeline
OL,14,     FBell and more.
OL,15,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,16,     FHannah French talks to organist
OL,17,     FWilliam Whitehead about the
OL,18,     F17th-century composer John Lugge,
OL,19,     Fwho spent most of his life working
OL,20,     Fat Exeter Cathedral.
