OL,5,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FFrom the University of Glasgow
OL,7,     FMemorial Chapel, with music by
OL,8,     FWeelkes, Harwood, Oliver Tarney
OL,9,     Fand Howells.
OL,10,G1900 Between the Ears: Songs for the
OL,11,G     Malago
OL,12,     FThere is a river in Bristol called
OL,13,     Fthe Malago. Small and often
OL,14,     Foverlooked. But now, a group of
OL,15,     Flocals have come together to write
OL,16,     Fsongs for it. And every song has a
OL,17,     Fstory to tell.
